  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2002-03-23.aud.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 8 songs; 47 min [1]. Said about its sound: Track 2 had two or three short dropouts and track 7 had one; these were mixed over and are now hard to detect [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Low Dog was effectively 'on tour' with the band, which is why many recordings from this period exist [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2002-03-23.aud.flac16**: taped by George \"Low Dog\" S.; transferred by Magnix; source: AUD MD > CD-R [1]. Also: Transfer path was CD-R to EAC to FLAC level 8, from a recording made by Low Dog, received directly from him [1]",
